    "description": "When the cookie cravings come on strong, there’s no need to worry, because these mix up fast and bake up incredibly delicious. Combine brown sugar with flour, baking soda, salt and rolled oats. Work in butter until you form a crumbly mixture, most of which you’ll press into a baking pan. Spread a whole bunch of yummy raspberry jam over it, then top with more crust crumbles. Bake until browned, then go pour yourself a glass of milk while they cool—soon you’ll get the cookie satisfaction you deserve!",
